Package: luna-video-studio
Version: 1.3.85
Section: video
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Goldisoft
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, ffmpeg, mediainfo, lsdvd, eject, libbluray2, libaacs0, libbdplus0, libdvdnav4, libdvdread8t64
Description: Luna Video Studio DVD and Blu-ray ripper
 GTK4 application to analyse and encode DVD and Blu-ray titles with FFmpeg,
 including a one-minute preview clip and optional automatic disc ejection.
